msgstr ""

#: ../../../about/deprecated.rst:36
msgid ""
"Boolean options such as ``share=on``/``share=off`` could be written in short "
"form as ``share`` and ``noshare``.  This is now deprecated and will cause a "
"warning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../about/deprecated.rst:41
msgid "``delay`` option for socket character devices (since 6.0)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../about/deprecated.rst:43
msgid ""
"The replacement for the ``nodelay`` short-form boolean option is "
"``nodelay=on`` rather than ``delay=off``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../about/deprecated.rst:47
msgid "Plugin argument passing through ``arg=<string>`` (since 6.1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../about/deprecated.rst:49
msgid ""
"Passing TCG plugins arguments through ``arg=`` is redundant is makes the "
"command-line less readable, especially when the argument itself consist of a "
"name and a value, e.g. ``-plugin plugin_name,arg=\"arg_name=arg_value\"``. "
"Therefore, the usage of ``arg`` is redundant. Single-word arguments are "
"treated as short-form boolean values, and passed to plugins as "
"``arg_name=on``. However, short-form booleans are deprecated and full "
"explicit ``arg_name=on`` form is preferred."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../about/deprecated.rst:58
msgid "``debug-threads`` option for ``-name`` (since 11.0)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../about/deprecated.rst:60
msgid ""
"The ``debug-threads`` option of the ``-name`` argument is now ignored. "
"Thread naming is unconditionally enabled for all platforms where it is "
"supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../about/deprecated.rst:65
msgid "``-mon`` option (since 11.1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../about/deprecated.rst:67
msgid ""
"The ``-mon`` option was the generic mechanism for creating monitor objects "
"if the convenience ``-qmp`` or ``-monitor`` options were not flexible "
"enough. The monitor objects have been converted to QOM, so ``-mon "
"mode=readline`` is replaced by ``-object monitor-hmp`` and ``-mon "
"mode=control`` is replaced by ``-object monitor-qmp``. The short convenience "
"options are not deprecated, only ``-mon``."
msgstr ""

